    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're finally <strong>fed up</strong> with your <strong>fleet</strong> and their incompetence. Take down all <strong>13</strong> of them one by one and claim your spot at the top. Along the way, you'll discover precious <strong>cargo dice</strong> that represent your ship's vitality and firepower. You may also encounter friendly <strong>merchants</strong>, <strong>carpenters</strong>, and potential <strong>crew members</strong> eager to join and assist you on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ship's <strong>cargo</strong> consists of <strong>dice</strong>, and their total pip values represent your ship's <strong>total HP</strong>. These dice also influence the number of <strong>damage dice</strong> you roll in combat. Be careful not to let your cargo's total value reach the dreaded number, as even rolling that in combat can have unfavorable consequences.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're finally <strong>fed up</strong> with your <strong>fleet</strong> and their incompetence. Take down all <strong>13</strong> of them one by one and claim your spot at the top. Along the way, you'll discover precious <strong>cargo dice</strong> that represent your ship's vitality and firepower. You may also encounter friendly <strong>merchants</strong>, <strong>carpenters</strong>, and potential <strong>crew members</strong> eager to join and assist you on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ship's <strong>cargo</strong> consists of <strong>dice</strong>, and their total pip values represent your ship's <strong>total HP</strong>. These dice also influence the number of <strong>damage dice</strong> you roll in combat. Be careful not to let your cargo's total value reach the dreaded number, as even rolling that in combat can have unfavorable consequences.</p>",
    "short_description": "Gather some cargo of dice and take down your fleet!",
